[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16885.03, "timestamp": "04:41:25", "text": "20美元。不，不是20。我觉得不是20。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16887.19, "timestamp": "04:41:27", "text": "其他应用也需要付费。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16888.948, "timestamp": "04:41:28", "text": "正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16891.03, "timestamp": "04:41:31", "text": "所以我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16894.39, "timestamp": "04:41:34", "text": "呃，如果我做的话，安迪·斯卡夫会更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16897.99, "timestamp": "04:41:37", "text": "像云朵或什么东西一样，但我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16902.23, "timestamp": "04:41:42", "text": "每月支付90美元。太疯狂了。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16906.39, "timestamp": "04:41:46", "text": "换算成我的货币是多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16911.11, "timestamp": "04:41:51", "text": "8000卢比。你好。"}]